Cell["\<\
Most of these option settings refer to details of the numerical algorithms \
and are beyond the scope of this introductory document. In most cases, the \
defaults work fine. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544465742639364*^9, 3.544465864370582*^9}, {
  3.5444659020661507`*^9, 3.544465971424685*^9}, {3.544466159594984*^9, 
