Cell["\<\
In this case the surprising choice of 900\[Degree] is generated. This is a \
valid solution although not the expected one. Constrained optimization can \
prevent such unexpected behaviour (see below):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.744294993926008*^9, 3.744295053936685*^9}, {
  3.744296068181036*^9, 3.744296081577737*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"29581f50-9487-4bdc-91f7-9d76cbcbf8f8"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["basic functionality; constrained optimization", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544595756798325*^9, 3.544595759461074*^9}, {
   3.7219504539442663`*^9, 3.72195046912052*^9}, {3.744294848686954*^9, 
   3.744294852984373*^9}, 3.744295061579648*^9},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"9a988188-6370-4728-afa8-f28af4d66402"],

Cell["Constraints may be added by using the syntax:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544595848523198*^9, 3.544595860873725*^9}, {
   3.54459590574984*^9, 3.5445959064413977`*^9}, 3.744294233847397*^9, {
   3.744295072030812*^9, 3.744295090330125*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"d8e882b6-5fa1-4060-9245-4591d3496058"],

Cell["\<\
MaximizeTransformationAmplitude[a\[Rule]b, events, \
{{p1,p1ini,{p1min,p1max}},{p2,p2ini,{p2min,p2max}}..} options]\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5445958642886257`*^9, 3.544595901401365*^9}, {
  3.744294236350815*^9, 3.744294264019548*^9}, {3.744295092978503*^9, 
  3.744295109925249*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"20f23459-b78e-471e-b032-005bbcf442bc"],

Cell["\<\
where the search is performed over a region constrained by the specified \
minimum and maximum values of the parameters. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.744295114295316*^9, 3.744295139175634*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"41ac661b-de6d-4dd4-afa5-df1a44ced352"],

Cell["\<\
For example, the following syntax shows the optimization of a pulse flip \
angle in order to maximize the inversion of z-magnetization, with the flip \
angle constrained to the range 0 to 2\[Pi]:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544596111027958*^9, 3.544596160952854*^9}, {
  3.7442944564566317`*^9, 3.744294471499875*^9}, {3.74429456368593*^9, 
  3.7442945684997797`*^9}, {3.744295146579534*^9, 3.744295160634415*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"613533a2-7928-4de4-8a30-62638b11751d"],

