Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Signal1D",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " reports the algorithm chosen for the particular simulation problem, \
reports that 1.47 Hz Lorentzian line broadening has been applied \
automatically, and that the number of points has been adjusted to get an even \
number, which is required for the fast Fourier transform algorithm."
}], "Text",
